CTM BusFinder is the Official App of CTM SpA that guides you during your trips in the Area of Cagliari.

Through the App, CTM does not access to any of your  personal data stored in the device.

With CTM BusFinder you can:
- Read the last news retrieved from the CTM site and Twitter account;
- See the route of the bus lines on the map with the list of bus stops and schedules;
- Plan your journey to reach your destinations  and see the details about the relevant bus stops;
- See the bus stops around you or in a selected area of interest;
- Consult the real-time data about the next bus transits and the relevant routes with reference to a bus stop of interest, also using a QR code reader; 
- See the list of ticket shops around you or in a selected area of interest;
- Manage a list of preferred bus stops for a quick access;
- Purchase CTM single and season electronic tickets;
- Validate electronic tickets by scanning QR codes in CTM buses.

BeaglePlug is the ultimate app for your e-mobility needs.
Wherever you are: at home, at work or on the road, with BeaglePlug you can find the best charging station and reach any destination.

How does it work? It’s very simple: Download the App for free and now you can:
• Easily find the charging station nearest you;
• Book an available socket and start the navigator to reach it;
• Monitor the charging and stop it once the necessary energy has accumulated;
• Easily pay via the App, by credit card or wallet;
• Request the Card for offline payments, without the need for a smartphone;
• Check the history of your refills and the respective costs at any time;
• Read reviews about other users' charging stations, and leave yours.

Don’t you still have a charging station at home?
Contact us and you will have the opportunity to test and manage with BeaglePlug even your personal charging station, in a smart way and at no extra cost to your electricity manager.

Let the BeaglePlug app become your most beneficial tool for electric driving.
Join us to observe our world with an unprecedented and revolutionary look.

Grazie ad un servizio offerto dal catasto italiano abbiamo realizzato questo navigatore di mappe che ti permette di:
visualizzare tutte le mappe catastali italiane aggiornate;
ricercare per indirizzo o per comune, foglio e particella;
conoscere o calcolare aree e distanze grafiche di ogni elemento della mappa;
sapere quali sono le particelle nelle tue vicinanze tramite geolocalizzazione;
visualizzare la posizione di punti fiduciali (PF), la loro monografia e attivare il navigatore che ti porterà fino ad individuarli perfettamente;
sovrapporre in trasparenza la mappa catastale con Google Maps, Bing Maps e Open Street Map.
Un nuovo modo di lavorare veloce e sicuro: usalo e fallo usare!
